<title>SWITZERLAND: Phonak 1996/97 profit steady.</title>
<headline>Phonak 1996/97 profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>STAEFA, Switzerland 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			17.5		vs 17.7</p>
<p> Turnover			 171		 vs 132</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Phonak Holding AG. These are provisional figures. It said final group profit would be around 17.5 million, representing a seven percent increase excluding one-off revenue of 1.3 million last year. &quot;The declared profit (including one-off revenue last year) will be about the same as in the previous year,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
